The following definitions are restated (verbatim up to namespace) from the Lean
formalisation in NoFourMUBS, https://github.com/JoeyT1994/NoFourMUBS, file
lean/NoFourMUBs/Basic.lean:

  * MUBTriples.IsUnitary  (MUBTriples/Basic.lean)      = NoFourMUBs.IsUnitary
  * MUBTriples.Unbiased   (MUBTriples/Basic.lean)      = NoFourMUBs.Unbiased
  * MUBTriples.FourMUBs   (MUBTriples/Statement.lean)  = NoFourMUBs.FourMUBs

